      "writtenOn": "2019-05-06T19:19:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this all of this new code is guarded by a new CONFIG define. Let\u0027s not define a weak function here and force anyone that uses the new CONFIG to provide this method (otherwise they will be a compiler error)\n\nYou can describe the contract in config.h as well (that defining this CONFIG_ option will require that board_get_aux_fw_chip_list also be defined)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 22,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "d6229a233966429769f6867f4bd1ebc03518a563",
